Fonts (not vendored here)

The production PDF/A-3b profile embeds Source Sans 3 and Source Code Pro
(Copyright Adobe Systems Incorporated), licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1. These font files are NOT included in this repository, so nothing here
redistributes them.

`infra/fop.xconf` IS included, and expects these five files in a `fonts/`
directory at the repository root:

    SourceSans3-Regular.ttf   SourceSans3-Bold.ttf   SourceSans3-It.ttf
    SourceCodePro-Regular.ttf SourceCodePro-Bold.ttf

They are published under exactly those names on the `release` branch of
https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-sans (TTF/) and
https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-code-pro (TTF/):

    mkdir -p fonts && cd fonts
    for f in SourceSans3-Regular SourceSans3-Bold SourceSans3-It; do
      curl -LO "https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-sans/raw/release/TTF/$f.ttf"
    done
    for f in SourceCodePro-Regular SourceCodePro-Bold; do
      curl -LO "https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-code-pro/raw/release/TTF/$f.ttf"
    done

Other distributions (Google Fonts among them) ship these families under different
file names, including variable-font builds; the names above are what fop.xconf
resolves. Alternatively use the Faktorei container, which ships the fonts. The
base-14 quickstart render needs no font fetch and embeds no third-party fonts.

